{
  "format": "regkit-bitfield",
  "name": "NVIDIA driver registry keys",
  "comment": "Driver registry keys read by the NVIDIA display driver. They're all under the display adapter class key, HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Class\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\XXXX, the XXXX depend on your adapter",
