        "\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\"
      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\nEncoding boolean\nzero    -- (default) Do nothing\nnonzero -- RM will use DDC port (value - 1) to read MXM ROM when it fails\nto read it using the default port.",
      "fields": [
