      "value_name": "RmCePceMap3",
      "key_paths": [
        "\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\"
      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type Dword\nEncoding Numeric Value\nOverrides Copy Engine LCE-PCE Mappings\nNV_REG_STR_RM_CE_PCE_MAP_PCE(i)_NONE - PCE(i) assigned to no LCE\nRmCePceMap holds the override for PCEs 0 through 7.\nRmCePceMap1 holds the override for PCEs 8 thorough 15.\nRmCePceMap2 holds the override for PCEs 16 through 24.\nRmCePceMap3 holds the override for PCEs 25 through 31.\nNote: PCE-LCE mappings and GRCE sharing work in conjunction.\nIf a GRCE has a PCE mapped to it explicitly in RmCePceMap or\nRmCePceMap1, it shouldn't be shared in RmCeGrceShared",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "RmCePceMap3",
          "bits": [0, 1, 2, 3],
          "states": [
            { "value": 8, "name": "SIZE_1" },
            { "value": 15, "name": "PCE_NONE" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
