      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\n0 - Post a command to DPU RTOS on DPU clock changes\n1 - Don't post a command to DPU RTOS on DPU clock changes\n0 - Disables DPU Falctrace usage (default)\n1 - Enables  DPU Falctrace usage",
