      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\n0:0 - Set to 1 to enable L0s during RM Load\n1:1 - Set to 1 to enable L1 during RM Load\nNote: This regkey is intended for testing purpose and should be used to enable\nASPM on no pstate or single pstate VBIOS",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "L0S",
