      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\n0:0 - Set to 1 to enable L0s config space/public bits\n1:1 - Set to 1 to enable L1 config space/public bits\n2:2 - Set to 1 to enable L1-CPM config space/public bits\nNote: This regkey is intended for testing purpose only.",
      "fields": [
