      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\nCaches whether an external device was found or not.\nFor now this is just a bool value, but we may cache more here going fwd.\nSee bug 607685.\nEncoding 0 --> Ext Device was not found - will skip probing\n1 --> Ext Device was found - do probing\nCan be disabled via NV_REG_STR_RM_DISABLE_REGISTRY_CACHE",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "RmExtDeviceCache",
          "bits": [0],
          "states": [
