      "comment": "TYPE DWORD\nThis regkey can be used to enable logging of VEID info associated with\nwith subcontext aware engines, allowing MODS interrupt checking\nNO      - Disable logging of the VEID to MODS (default).\nYES     - Enable logging of the VEID to MODS.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "RMLogVeidToMods",
