      "comment": "TYPE DWORD\nThis regkey can be used to enable logging of the WARP_ESR_PC to MODS during\nan SM exception.\nDEFAULT - Use the default setting for logging of the WARP_ESR_PC.\nYES     - Enable logging of the WARP_ESR_PC to MODS.",
