      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\nNuma allocations allow for skipping reclaim less than a specified memory occupancy threshold.\nThis override allows for its tuning, value supplied here shall indicate a percent of free memory\nless than which GFP_RECLAIM flag will be dropped.",
