    {
      "name": "RMNvLogExtraBuffer1",
      "value_name": "RMNvLogExtraBuffer1",
      "key_paths": [
        "\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\"
      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "NV_REG_STR_RM_NVLOG_EXTRA_BUFFER_2        RMNvLogExtraBuffer2\nNV_REG_STR_RM_NVLOG_EXTRA_BUFFER_3        RMNvLogExtraBuffer3\nNV_REG_STR_RM_NVLOG_EXTRA_BUFFER_4        RMNvLogExtraBuffer4\nNV_REG_STR_RM_NVLOG_EXTRA_BUFFER_5        RMNvLogExtraBuffer5\nNV_REG_STR_RM_NVLOG_EXTRA_BUFFER_6        RMNvLogExtraBuffer6\nType DWORD\nUsed to specify up to 6 additional logging buffers\nEncoding:\n_BUFFER_FLAGS\nx: uses NVLOG_BUFFER_FLAGS fields, for main nvlog buffer\n_BUFFER_SIZE\nn: Size of main buffer, in kilobytes"
    },
    {
      "name": "RmNvsrFlickerControl",
      "value_name": "RmNvsrFlickerControl",
      "key_paths": [
        "\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\\"
      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "TYPE DWORD\nDefines parameters for flicker control, used in DC balancing on NVSR panel only.\n_PRE_FRAME_WEIGHT, _CUR_FRAME_WEIGHT, _THRESHOLD:\nParameters to calculate the target line for short frame.\n(Details in headHandleNvsrDCBalancing())\nTarget Line = ((previous frame lines// _PRE_FRAME_WEIGHT) +\n(Current frame lines// _CUR_FRAME_WEIGHT)) /\n(_PRE_FRAME_WEIGHT + CUR_FRAME_WEIGHT)\nAdjustment only happens when current frame line less than\n(previous frame line// _THRESHOLD/255)\nBelow parameters are to prevent additional stutter caused by frame extension\n_MAX_DELAY_TIME:  The max time a frame can be extended.\n_MIN_MARGIN_TIME: The min time to keep before frame ends.\nUnit is 0.1ms. Default = (0.2ms) (2)",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "PRE_FRAME_WEIGHT",
          "bits": [0, 1, 2, 3],
          "states": [
            { "value": 2, "name": "DEFAULT" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CUR_FRAME_WEIGHT",
          "bits": [4, 5, 6, 7],
          "states": [
            { "value": 1, "name": "DEFAULT" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "THRESHOLD",
          "bits": [8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15],
          "states": [
            { "value": 230, "name": "DEFAULT" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "MAX_DELAY_TIME",
          "bits": [16, 17, 18, 19]
        },
        {
          "name": "MIN_MARGIN_TIME",
          "bits": [20, 21, 22, 23],
          "states": [
            { "value": 2, "name": "DEFAULT" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
