      "comment": "Type BINARY\nEncoding:\nstruct {\nNvU8  version;  // 0x10 = 1.0\nNvU8  entries;  // Number of entries in the following entry array.\nNvU8  regIndex;\nNvU8  regValue;\n} entry[entries]\n}"
    },
    {
