      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\nEncoding NvU32\nOverride to disable all thermal policy software slowdowns on the GPU.\nDISABLE\n_DEFAULT  - Keep default settings from VBIOS\n_DISABLED - Explicitly disable all software slowdown, override VBIOS settings.",
      "fields": [
