      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type DWORD\nSet a cap on the number of TPCs used for graphics workloads. RM will use the\nminimum of the post-floorsweeping configuration, VBIOS setting and this registry\noverride as the final setting.\nThis only applies to chips that support compute only GPC/TPC (Hopper+)."
    },
