      ],
      "bit_width": 32,
      "comment": "Type: Dword\nEncoding:\nUSE_DEFAULTS   0   --> No effect.\nENABLE         1   --> Use PMU HW I2C if supported and when possible.\nDo not set enabled at the same time as any other RMUse*I2c.",
      "fields": [
        {
