      "comment": "Type: Dword\nEncoding:\nUSE_DEFAULTS   0   --> No effect.\nENABLE         1   --> Use PMU SPI if supported and when possible.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "RMUsePmuSpi",
          "bits": [0],
          "states": [
