      "comment": "Type DWORD\nBIT 1:0: All Data validation\n0 - Default\n1 - Validate the kernel data - buffers and handles. Bit 3:2 decides buffers\n2 - Do not validate the kernel data - buffers and handles\nBIT 3:2: Buffer validation\n1 - Validate the kernel buffers\n2 - Do not validate the kernel buffers\nBIT 3:2: Handle validation\n1 - Validate the handles\n2 - Do not validate the handles",
